  "prefLabel": "Env-A 401.03 Definitions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 401.03 Definitions. For purposes of this chapter, the following definitions shall apply:\n\n(a) “Average emission rate” means “average emission rate” as defined in RSA 125-D:2, VII, reprinted in Appendix B;\n\n(b) “Baseline average emission rate” means “baseline average emission rate” as defined in RSA 125-D:2, VIII, reprinted in Appendix B;\n\n(c) “Baseline emissions” means “baseline emissions” as defined in RSA 125-D:2, III, reprinted in Appendix B;\n\n(d) “Class A major source” means a source within the group identified in RSA 125-D:3, I(a)(1), reprinted in Appendix B;\n\n(e) “Class B major source” means a source within the group identified in RSA 125-D:3, I(a)(2), reprinted in Appendix B; and\n\n(f) “Maximum total heat input capacity” means “maximum total heat input capacity” as defined in RSA 125-D:2, IX, reprinted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. #10288, eff 3-19-13; ss by #13641, eff 5-23-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a400.html"
}
